        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Hulett, Dave Pressler, Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Jay Kogen, Wallace Wolodarsky\n- Television Series: The X's, The Simpsons\n- Episodes: Bart of Darkness\n- Roles: artist, co-creator, teleplay co-writer\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Hulett was an artist and the co-creator of the short-lived Nickelodeon series The X's with Dave Pressler.\n- Bart of Darkness was an episode in the sixth season of The Simpsons.\n- The teleplay for Bart of Darkness was co-written by Jay Kogen and Wallace Wolodarsky.",
